    <string name="hamlet_a_help_text">Build your village and explore with a team of heroes. Two protect the front line; keep healers and mages behind them. Grove counters Forge, Forge counters Dawn, Dawn counters Grove. Matching factions and hero bonds strengthen your formation.\nWelcome 36 heroes using invitations earned from village work, the inn and adventures. Draws have rarity guarantees; duplicates become fragments. Targeted recruitment and fragments let you choose a hero. Campaign rescues remain available. Improve levels, skills and complete equipment sets to progress.\nThe journal connects village duties, optional daily tasks and expeditions. Heroes on village duty still fight. On short visits, collect produce and expedition rewards, then use quick raids on mastered three-star routes. During longer sessions, keep fighting or gathering freely. Defeats cost nothing. No energy or daily attempt limits. Production continues while you are away.</string>
