    <string name="hamlet_a_facilities_help">Place these original buildings yourself. Completed facilities boost heroes, production and training; improve them through the village’s building actions.</string>
    <string name="hamlet_a_facility_0">Earns coins through orders and recruitment invitations while away: one every 12 hours at rank 1, 9 hours 36 minutes at rank 2, or 8 hours at rank 3. Only the highest completed inn rank counts.</string>
    <string name="hamlet_a_facility_1">Provides skill books, hero HP and access to ongoing research.</string>
    <string name="hamlet_a_facility_2">Produces ore and enables equipment crafting.</string>
    <string name="hamlet_a_facility_3">Increases resource production. Storage has no limit and cannot be raided.</string>
    <string name="hamlet_a_facility_4">Enables militia training and increases march capacity.</string>
    <string name="hamlet_a_facility_5">Welcomes travellers, improves the village and earns coins through orders.</string>
